{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受提示过于密集，部分段落切换较快，观众可能来不及消化；而且人物行为背后的因果解释不如Y铺陈得充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮关键词能让观众迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理转折，而感受提示按音乐实际进展出现，不必一次面对整堆描述，听觉与视觉也更容易对应。尤其是从怀念亲近、害怕孤单，到不愿为留住关系而继续忍让，前后形成了清楚的情绪线索，音乐中的主题回归也得到具体呈现。Y的优势是人物动机解释得更充分，特别是想念过去与害怕孤单之间的区别，但它的感受词集中排列，较难辨认情绪在音乐中的具体先后变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0acbb7f4-706a-4154-9867-231c3e6a8178", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090948576359Z", "elapsed_seconds": 156.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:12:25.371228+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "19585238181168f3343de5d1da82a0442dad9714c3e80a31653a3e7da7dd0c50", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg